  "scope": "scripts/qualify_runtime_plcsim_tcpip.py --mode normal on an owned PLCSIM Advanced V8 TCP/IP instance (scratch CPU 1511-1 PN V4.1 at 192.168.0.1) from Debug builds of the frozen commit: the complete normal-mode flow and its independent verification passed again, and runtime_web_diagnostics kind syslog read Syslog.Browse with count 5 through the owned Web API session: status read, five raw RFC 5424 entries (web server login, OPC UA server events) with the lifetime and loss counters; count 21 was refused with RuntimeDiagnosticSelectionInvalid before any request. Syslog.Browse needs the device function right WebReadSyslog ('Read syslog buffer of the CPU'); without it the first run of the day answered permissionDenied (provider error 2), so the runner now discovers the right from the refused grant's availableRights list and grants it.",
